    "reviews": "\u201cIf you don't play Cross Blitz, you're missing out.\u201d<br>Eurogamer DE<br><br>\u201cWith a stellar soundtrack and a wealth of creatively designed and visually impressive cards, Cross Blitz isn\u2019t just a card game; it\u2019s a deckbuilding journey that continually surprises and delights.\u201d<br>Tryhard<br><br>\u201cCross Blitz is one of the most entertaining deck-battling games I have played so far.\u201d<br>Gamegrin<br>",
